{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-4850-r4518388","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Crotopo Soup","sourcePageId":4850,"sourceRevision":"4518388","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-21T16:26:57Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Crotopo%20Soup&oldid=4518388","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:38:30.966Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Public domain recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for soup","Category:Recipes using bread","Category:Recipes using broth and stock","Category:Recipes using egg yolk","Category:Recipes using ham","Category:Recipes using veal","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"42051e78e2ed6663a4ff11e23d2cf6dea2b51d00e9e1685e9e4cceb098ff03b9","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Soup recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\n'''Crotopo soup''' aka croute au pot (Fr.)\n==Ingredients==\n* [[Cookbook:Clear soup|Clear soup]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Pound|pound]] (230 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]]) lean [[Cookbook:Veal|veal]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Ounce|ounces]] (85 g) cooked [[Cookbook:Ham|ham]] \n* 1 [[Cookbook:Egg yolk|egg yolk]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Pepper|Pepper]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n* [[Cookbook:Bread|French bread rolls]]\n* [[Cookbook:Broth|Broth]]\n\n==Procedure==\n# Pound the veal in a [[Cookbook:Mortar and Pestle|mortar]].\n# Add ham with some fat in it, the egg yolk, salt, pepper, and very little nutmeg, and pound some more.\n# Pass through a [[Cookbook:Sieve|sieve]].\n# Cut the rolls into slices and spread them with the meat mixture.\n# Place them in the [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] and [[Cookbook:Baking|bake]] until colored.\n# Cut the rolls in halves or quarters, and place them in a tureen.\n# Just before serving, pour a very good clear broth over them.\n\n{{decameron}}\n\n[[Category:Recipes for soup]]\n[[Category:Recipes using veal]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ham]]\n[[Category:Recipes using bread]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg yolk]]\n[[Category:Recipes using broth and stock]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Crotopo Soup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Clear soup","sourceText":"Clear soup","amountText":"Clear soup","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ pound (230 g) lean veal","sourceText":"½ pound (230 g) lean veal","amountText":"½ pound (230 g) lean veal","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"3 ounces (85 g) cooked ham","sourceText":"3 ounces (85 g) cooked ham","amountText":"3 ounces (85 g) cooked ham","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 egg yolk","sourceText":"1 egg yolk","amountText":"1 egg yolk","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Salt","sourceText":"Salt","amountText":"Salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"Pepper","sourceText":"Pepper","amountText":"Pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 pinch of nutmeg","sourceText":"1 pinch of nutmeg","amountTe